Every time dangerous, dangerous.

11
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:40,997
We like it serious, serious, oh.

12
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:45,577
Looking deep in the dream
there is the one in pain.

13
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:49,800
Turns out that's the one who
means the most to you today.

14
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:53,537
Adventure calls now, let's go.

15
