All the love and the tears
in the world we're in.

24
00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:24,797
United gently bringing up
our thought again, yeah.

25
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:28,737
With the foolish ones
we love, we'll carry on.

26
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:33,980
Till we see the light, the sun will rise.

27
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:39,937
The greatest fight at its core.

28
00:01:40,020 --> 00:01:42,797
Is against myself forevermore.

29
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:45,397
Come on, let's do it now, let's go.

30
